  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square marker painting of a pile of orange, red and yellow cartoon creatures with horns and teeth against a flat blue sky.",
    "description": "A square marker painting on wood. A heap of rounded creatures in orange, rust, red and yellow rises from the bottom against a flat cyan sky that fills the upper third. The creatures have single white eyes with pink or red pupils, white curled horns and tabs, and one at right has a wide red mouth with white teeth. A spiky yellow burst sits at centre, an antenna with a star at upper centre, and tall white rabbit ears at the top. Thick black outlines, flat marker fills with wood grain visible.",
    "impression": "The one crowd painting with a sky, which makes it a landscape: a hill of creatures under a hot blue day. The warm palette against cyan is like a desert at noon. The pile seems to be looking up at something off the top of the panel, patiently, like a crowd waiting for fireworks.",
